/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Local tooling and editor state
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Build output for the browser dev console
crates/quokka-wasm/pkg/
crates/quokka-wasm/www/quokka_wasm*.js
crates/quokka-wasm/www/quokka_wasm*.wasm

# Saved images are build artefacts, not sources: the files are the truth and
# an image is a live cache of them (docs/design.md, *Source of truth*). Every
# command saves `.qi`; `.quokka-image` is the older name.
*.qi
*.quokka-image

# The brand pack, unpacked into assets/brand/. The archive itself is redundant
# with it, and nothing can reference a file inside a zip.
assets/*.zip
